  "description": "\"Please… I just need a mouthful.\"\nFor fourteen years, Gayoon had lived like a little sister to Taejun, until the day she blurted out something unthinkable.\n\"Give me just a mouthful, then I’ll quit. I’ll let it go.\"\nGayoon has secretly loved Taejun all through the fourteen years they’ve lived together.\nOne day, she accidentally catches him pleasuring himself.\nFrom that moment on, all she can think about is Taejun’s “thing”… and in the end, she can’t help but beg him for just a mouthful.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12884600)",
